msgstr "``particle_jitter``"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:102
msgid "The effect of aligned versus irregular particle packing"
msgstr "规则排列与不规则堆积的粒子分布对结果的影响"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:104
msgid ""
"The default solver voxel size is 25 mm, with two particles per voxel axis "
"(eight per interior voxel). Material comparisons reuse the same random "
"offsets to avoid confusing a change in packing with a change in material "
"response. Only ``particle_jitter`` compares aligned particles with jittered "
"particles. Use ``--variant_index 0``, ``1``, or ``2`` to inspect a single "
"specimen; the jitter preset has two variants."
msgstr ""
"求解器默认体素大小为 25 "
"mm，每个体素的每个轴向布置两个粒子，即内部体素含八个粒子。材料对比复用相同的随机偏移，避免将粒子堆积变化误认为材料响应变化；只有 "
"``particle_jitter`` 预设对比规则排列和随机扰动后的粒子。用 ``--variant_index 0``、``1`` 或 ``2`` "
"可以单独查看一个试样；粒子扰动预设只有两个变体。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:111
msgid ""
"To apply sustained compression, add ``--press_spheres`` to either sphere "
"preset:"
msgstr "要施加持续压缩，可为任一球体预设添加 ``--press_spheres``："

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:118
msgid ""
"The plates descend after a two-second settling period and hold the spheres "
"under compression. Compare the lateral expansion and volume response while "
"keeping Young's modulus fixed. Let the simulation continue after loading so "
"you can distinguish transient motion from the settled shape."
msgstr "静置两秒后，平板开始下降，并持续压缩球体。保持杨氏模量不变，比较横向膨胀和体积响应。加载后让仿真继续运行，以区分瞬态运动和最终稳定的形状。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:123
msgid ""
"See :ref:`newton-tuning-mpm` for the preset values and guidance on checking "
"resolution, timestep, and convergence before interpreting material behavior."
msgstr "预设数值及检查分辨率、时间步长、收敛情况的方法见 :ref:`newton-tuning-mpm` 。解释材料行为之前，应先完成这些检查。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:128
msgid "Approaching the rigid-body limit"
msgstr "接近刚体极限"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:130
msgid ""
"The ``rigid_body_equivalence.py`` tutorial compares spheres, cubes, and "
"capsules on two identical inclines. MJWarp simulates rigid bodies on the "
"left; Newton MPM simulates particle versions on the right. Corresponding "
"objects share their color, initial placement relative to the ramp, outer "
"dimensions, and total mass."
msgstr ""
"``rigid_body_equivalence.py`` 教程在两个相同斜面上对比球体、立方体和胶囊体。左侧由 MJWarp 模拟刚体，右侧由 "
"Newton MPM 模拟对应的粒子对象。相互对应的对象具有相同的颜色、相对斜面的初始位置、外部尺寸和总质量。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:147
msgid ""
"The MPM objects use a large finite stiffness and pressure-yield threshold to"
" approximate a rigid material. Compare their rolling, sliding, and shape "
"retention with the rigid bodies. MPM remains a discretized continuum, so a "
"large stiffness does not guarantee exact rigid-body motion: grid resolution,"
" particle sampling, timestep, and solver convergence still matter."
msgstr ""
"MPM 对象采用较大但有限的刚度和压力屈服阈值，近似刚性材料。将它们的滚动、滑动及形状保持情况与刚体进行对比。MPM "
"本质上仍是离散化的连续介质模型，因此较大刚度并不保证得到完全相同的刚体运动；网格分辨率、粒子采样、时间步长和求解器收敛情况仍会影响结果。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:153
msgid ""
"Use ``--mpm_young_modulus`` and ``--mpm_yield_pressure`` to explore the "
"transition to a softer or yielding material. Keep ``--voxel_size``, "
"``--mpm_substeps``, and ``--solver_iterations`` fixed when comparing "
"material values, then vary them separately to check the numerical "
"approximation."
msgstr ""
"用 ``--mpm_young_modulus`` 和 ``--mpm_yield_pressure`` "
"探索材料逐渐变软或发生屈服时的变化。对比材料参数时，保持 ``--voxel_size``、``--mpm_substeps`` 和 "
"``--solver_iterations`` 不变，再单独调整它们，检查数值近似的影响。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:160
msgid "Reconstructing a fluid surface"
msgstr "重建流体表面"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:162
msgid ""
"The ``surface_reconstruction.py`` tutorial drops a water blob into a shallow"
" pool. It shows how to turn the particle positions into a continuous surface"
" for rendering, while leaving the particle simulation unchanged."
msgstr ""
"``surface_reconstruction.py`` "
"教程将一团水落入浅水池，展示如何在不改变粒子仿真的情况下，将粒子位置重建为用于渲染的连续表面。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:177
msgid "Run the same scene again with another ``--surface_preset``:"
msgstr "换一个 ``--surface_preset``，再次运行同一场景："

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:179
msgid "Surface comparisons"
msgstr "表面对比"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:183
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "预设"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:184
msgid "Change relative to ``balanced``"
msgstr "相对于 ``balanced`` 的变化"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:185
msgid "``balanced``"
msgstr "``balanced``"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:186
msgid ""
"25 mm reconstruction grid, anisotropic kernels, one mesh-smoothing pass"
msgstr "25 mm 重建网格、各向异性核、一次网格平滑"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:187
msgid "``coarse_grid``"
msgstr "``coarse_grid``"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:188
msgid "50 mm reconstruction grid"
msgstr "50 mm 重建网格"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:189
msgid "``isotropic``"
msgstr "``isotropic``"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:190
msgid "Isotropic kernels"
msgstr "各向同性核"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:191
msgid "``heavy_smoothing``"
msgstr "``heavy_smoothing``"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:192
msgid "Six mesh-smoothing passes"
msgstr "六次网格平滑"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:194
msgid ""
"Look at the splash sheets, small surface features, and the pool as it "
"settles. Use ``--fluid_render_mode both`` to inspect the mesh alongside the "
"source particles. The reconstruction grid is separate from the MPM solver "
"grid; changing it affects surface detail and extraction cost rather than "
"particle motion. Individual ``--surface_*`` options override the selected "
"preset."
msgstr ""
"观察飞溅形成的薄片、细小的表面特征，以及水池逐渐静止的过程。用 ``--fluid_render_mode both`` "
"可同时查看网格和原始粒子。重建网格独立于 MPM 求解器网格，改变它会影响表面细节和提取开销，不会改变粒子运动。单独指定 ``--surface_*``"
" 选项可以覆盖所选预设。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:200
msgid ""
"The tutorial constructs ``newton.geometry.ParticleSurface`` after "
"``sim.reset()`` and passes it to ``ParticleSurfaceRenderer``. The simulation"
" loop calls the renderer's ``update()`` before ``sim.render()`` so the "
"viewers receive the mesh for the current particle state. See :ref:`newton-"
"using-mpm` for this integration pattern."
msgstr ""
"教程在 ``sim.reset()`` 后创建 ``newton.geometry.ParticleSurface``，再将它传给 "
"``ParticleSurfaceRenderer``。仿真循环在 ``sim.render()`` 前调用渲染器的 "
"``update()``，使可视化器收到与当前粒子状态对应的网格。此接入方式见 :ref:`newton-using-mpm` 。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:208
msgid ""
"Surface reconstruction supports Newton GL and Newton RTX only, not Kit, "
"Viser, or Rerun. Select ``--fluid_render_mode particles`` to use these "
"visualizers without surface reconstruction."
msgstr ""
"表面重建仅支持 Newton GL 和 Newton RTX，不支持 Kit、Viser 或 Rerun。使用这些可视化器时，可选择 "
"``--fluid_render_mode particles``，仅显示粒子，不进行表面重建。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:214
msgid "Comparing one-way and two-way coupling"
msgstr "对比单向与双向耦合"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:216
msgid ""
"The ``mpm-g1-coupling`` example uses a trained G1 walking policy to cross "
"shallow sand, snow, and clay strips on a rigid runway. The robot starts on "
"the bare runway before reaching the particles. This comparison shows how "
"material resistance affects a controller trained for rigid terrain."
msgstr ""
"``mpm-g1-coupling`` 示例使用训练好的 G1 "
"行走策略，穿过刚性跑道上的浅层沙、雪和黏土带。机器人先从没有粒子的跑道上起步，再接触粒子。该对比展示了材料阻力如何影响在刚性地形上训练的控制器。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:221
msgid "Run the two-way comparison from a source checkout:"
msgstr "从源码检出目录运行双向耦合对比："

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:228
msgid ""
"Then repeat it with ``--coupling one_way``. Both modes let the robot "
"displace particles. Two-way coupling returns particle reaction forces to the"
" robot; one-way coupling sets proxy feedback relaxation to zero from the "
"initial state. Compare the robot's progress and balance as well as the "
"displaced particles. The policy may slow down, become stuck, or fall when it"
" encounters the material."
msgstr ""
"然后改用 ``--coupling one_way`` "
"再运行一次。两种模式下，机器人都会推动粒子。双向耦合将粒子反作用力传回机器人；单向耦合则从初始状态起，将代理反馈的松弛系数设为零。除了观察粒子位移，还应对比机器人的前进情况和平衡状态。遇到材料时，策略可能使机器人减速、卡住或跌倒。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:234
msgid ""
"By default, the example exposes the robot's full collision geometry to MPM. "
"Use ``--proxy_bodies feet`` or ``--proxy_bodies lower_legs`` to explore how "
"the choice of coupled geometry affects interaction. Both ``--proxy_mode`` "
"choices, ``lagged`` and ``staggered``, support feedback; the scheduling mode"
" alone does not select one-way coupling. See :ref:`newton-coupled-solvers` "
"for the proxy configuration and feedback controls."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，示例让机器人的完整碰撞几何参与 MPM 耦合。可以用 ``--proxy_bodies feet`` 或 ``--proxy_bodies "
"lower_legs`` 探索耦合几何的选择如何影响交互。``--proxy_mode`` 的 ``lagged`` 和 ``staggered`` "
"两种调度方式都支持反馈；仅改变调度模式不会将耦合切换为单向。代理配置和反馈控制见 :ref:`newton-coupled-solvers` 。"

#: source/how-to/mpm_tutorials.rst:241
msgid ""
"The example requires CUDA and downloads the published ``Isaac-Velocity-"
"Flat-G1`` policy unless you supply ``--checkpoint``. It is also available in"
" the installed package:"
msgstr ""
"该示例需要 CUDA。除非通过 ``--checkpoint`` 指定检查点，否则会下载已发布的 ``Isaac-Velocity-Flat-G1`` "
"策略。安装软件包后也可运行："
